  "articleBody": "A backyard cottage is usually a detached accessory dwelling unit (ADU) with independent living, sleeping, cooking, and bathroom facilities. In San Diego County, the right design depends on whether the property is inside a city or an unincorporated area, along with lot conditions, setbacks, utilities, fire requirements, and the intended use. A coordinated design-build plan can address these items before construction begins.",
